Subject: [PATCH 08/10] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../{Swift.Span+Span.Raw.swift => Swift.Span.swift}               | 0
 .../{Swift.MutableSpan+Span.swift => Swift.MutableSpan.swift}     | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Span/Absorbed swift-span-byte/{Swift.Span+Span.Raw.swift => Swift.Span.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Span/{Swift.MutableSpan+Span.swift => Swift.MutableSpan.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Span/Absorbed swift-span-byte/Swift.Span+Span.Raw.swift b/Sources/Span/Absorbed swift-span-byte/Swift.Span.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Span/Absorbed swift-span-byte/Swift.Span+Span.Raw.swift
rename to Sources/Span/Absorbed swift-span-byte/Swift.Span.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Span/Swift.MutableSpan+Span.swift b/Sources/Span/Swift.MutableSpan.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Span/Swift.MutableSpan+Span.swift
rename to Sources/Span/Swift.MutableSpan.swift
